WEBVTT

00:00.440 --> 00:01.840
Enough

00:02.520 --> 00:04.480
I gave you so much time

00:04.560 --> 00:06.080
And you've understood nothing

00:06.360 --> 00:07.720
You have no ability

00:07.800 --> 00:08.800
And aren't ruthless enough

00:08.920 --> 00:10.400
What will you use to go north?

00:10.480 --> 00:11.000
Your elder brother

00:11.080 --> 00:13.120
At least can defend this half of the realm

00:13.200 --> 00:14.600
You

00:14.800 --> 00:15.960
Just honestly

00:16.040 --> 00:17.880
Be a carefree prince

00:20.000 --> 00:30.000
"Chancellor Chen has ordered to cut the weeds and dig out the roots. Forgive us."
